7.2 Backend
Recommended: Node.js with Express.js 
Option 1: Node.js with Express.js
		Pros: JavaScript across full stack, async/event-driven for integrations, fast development
Cons: Less mature for enterprise-scale applications
Option 2: .NET Core (C#)
Pros: Enterprise-grade, excellent performance, strong typing, Microsoft ecosystem integration
Cons: Steeper learning curve, Windows development (but cross-platform now)
Option 3: Python with Django/Flask
Pros: Excellent for data science/forecasting, simple syntax, rich libraries
Cons: Slower performance than Node.js or .NET
Recommendation: .NET Core for enterprise robustness OR Node.js for rapid development
